--Description:  Construct the labelled dataset while eliminating the type-mismatch
--              by converting ACCIDENT.consecutive_number (STRING) to INT64; all
--              joins therefore use INT64 keys.  Components:
--              1) person_stats  – keep crashes with >1 distinct persons and count
